sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Sistema emisor
  participant R as REST adapter
  participant A as AnularDocumentos
  participant X as ubl+signing
  participant S as sunat-soap
  participant T as TicketPoller
  participant P as persistence

  C->>R: POST /v1/anulaciones {detalles:[{tipo, serie, numero, motivo}]}
  R->>A: anular(tenant, comando)
  A->>P: cargar documentos · validar ACEPTADO* y serie F
  A->>X: UBL VoidedDocuments RA-YYYYMMDD-N → firmar
  A->>S: sendSummary(RA.zip)
  S-->>A: ticket
  A->>P: RA ENVIADO · outbox(CONSULTAR_TICKET)
  R-->>C: 202 {id, estado: ENVIADO, ticket}
  T->>S: getStatus(ticket)
  S-->>T: 0 + CDR
  T->>P: RA ACEPTADO · documentos → ANULADO
